row data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>18</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>18</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>36</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we solve the system corresponding to the final matrix equation using Gaussian elimination, as follows: </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"101\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 19.765em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D440 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 1em; padding-bottom: 0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"4\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable justify=\"left\" style=\"min-width: 5.848em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; border-left: 0.07em solid; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-right: